  "summary": "Malicious code in @httttt/mcp-npx-fetch-1 (npm)",
  "details": "A trojanized clone of the @tokenizin/mcp-npx-fetch MCP content-fetch tool. The package's \"start\" script downloads a remote binary from a Huawei Cloud OBS bucket (hxxps://ys-obs-cc9d[.]obs[.]cn-north-1[.]myhuaweicloud[.]com/javaagent), saves it as./javaagent, makes it executable, and runs it. The bundled MCP server code itself is a copy of the legitimate tool; the remote binary download-and-execute is the injected payload.",
